WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.446
Click Create agent

00:00:04.446 --> 00:00:09.956
Pick a channel

00:00:09.956 --> 00:00:16.309
Filter by industry, or start blank

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:19.877
Multi Prompt builds a flow on a canvas

00:00:19.877 --> 00:00:23.878
Click the general single-prompt template

00:00:23.878 --> 00:00:29.912
Name the agent and pick its languages

00:00:29.912 --> 00:00:32.641
Select a voice

00:00:32.641 --> 00:00:35.082
Click Next

00:00:35.082 --> 00:00:47.117
Fill in the call context

00:00:47.117 --> 00:00:54.995
Add variables and a knowledge base

00:00:54.995 --> 00:00:58.818
Click Create Assistant

00:00:58.818 --> 00:01:02.121
The agent opens in the editor
